# ── Line endings: one law for the whole repository ─────────────
# All text is stored and checked out with LF. The generated files
# are already written LF on every OS (scripts/ingest.py guarantees
# it), so nothing churns and no CRLF warnings appear on Windows.
# Batch files are the one exception: cmd.exe prefers CRLF.
*        text=auto eol=lf
*.bat    text eol=crlf
# Spreadsheet data belongs to Excel: stored byte-faithful, never
# normalized (also silences the CRLF notice on every commit).
*.csv    -text

# ── Binaries: never normalized, never diffed as text ───────────
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.webp   binary
*.ico    binary
*.pdf    binary
*.woff2  binary
*.zip    binary
